The Magic rewrite cuts the query's body into supplementary predicates of
the query's own, and the limit refuses one of them, named as the query;
full materialization has no such predicates and is refused while deriving
path/2.  Where the limit falls depends on how many tuples a strategy
derives before the query's predicates, so the rewrite without factoring,
which holds no walk, is refused deriving path/2 at this limit.  The golden
file pins the default's message.
